.TH FLIGHT3D 2
.SH NAME
flight3d \- reusable three-dimensional flight model interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B include "danby/flight3d.m";
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Flight3d
separates a six-state model (x, lateral position, height, and their three
velocities) from the common live interface.  A model supplies initial state,
derivatives, observation time, and labelled parameter bounds.  Bounds include
explicit minima so signed aim, spin, and aerodynamic curve remain directly
manipulable.
.PP
The client integrates with RK4 and presents synchronized side and plan views.
Ground impact is located by interpolation between integration states.
.SH SOURCE
.B /module/danby/flight3d.m
.br
.B /appl/temple/flight3d.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR ballistics (2),
